ember 2026!With that we've been working on Progression (nothing paid btw), new cards, the Mystic (over 90 new cards for them alone), match history, feats (achievements), and a bunch of bug fixes!We've got an absolutely massiv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T09:51:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4083130-1840944183783876","game_id":"steam-4083130","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - 4","summary":"Dev Log - Update 4Hi everybody!Updates breaking saves has been on the top of our radar for a while now, and it’s finally fixed with this patch (we believe!), unfortunately there may be one last break while we store data better.Watching content on your decks (especially some of the fun Bell of Mercy combos) has been fun and please keep sharing screenshots of crazy boards you build up!We’re working through building more cards and encounters, we’re focusing heavily on some chaining and combination ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T13:10:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183783876","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4083130-1840310314349104","game_id":"steam-4083130","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 3 - Major Content Release","summary":"Dev Log - Update 3We’re heavy into the preparation for PAX Australia now, please join us if you can!We’ve fixed a lot of the longer term bugs now and feel combat is feeling the most solid it ever has been. We really wanted to give you the opportunity to play some of the latest cards we’ve made, especially strengthening the Legion’s heal builds and higher curve Coven builds.We’re playing around with increasing the number of activate abilities that are available to you each turn, there has been qu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T11:10:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349104","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4083130-1837955055360699","game_id":"steam-4083130","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.7.04 - Tinykin Released!","summary":"Dev Log - v0.7.04We’re fast approaching the release of the game and are wanted to give everybody the opportunity to play the Tinykin before we head into our crunch for PAX Australia.Thank you to everybody with the amazing feedback provided. There have been a few things that have stood out to us quite a bit:Main FeedbackWe’re not hitting the mark with the Tutorial. We’re going to work on this better, the game is SOOO much deeper than it seems on the surface and we haven’t done a good way to teach","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T07:59:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4083130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4083130":"2026-10-26T11:23:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4083130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:51Z"},"4812750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:52Z"}},"context_